{"pageid": 480, "title": "Book of Cutter 1", "revid": 2955, "categories": ["Comics", "Spinoffs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\"><i>Book of Cutter</i> #1</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/91/Book_of_Cutter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241027083350\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1 A Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/91/Book_of_Cutter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241027083350\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/91/Book_of_Cutter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241027083350 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/91/Book_of_Cutter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241027083350 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Book of Cutter 1 A Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Book_of_Cutter_1_A_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Book of Cutter 1 A Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 29, 2025</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\"><i>Book of Butcher</i> #1</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Book of Cutter</i> #1</b> is a one-shot horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> centered on the character <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> and was published by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a> on January 29, 2025.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>As it crosses its 5th anniversary, the <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a> unveils one of its darkest chapters yet in this oversized one-shot exploring a brand new facet to the mythos of monsters... and the ones who hunt them.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a>, a former pack hunter who renounced her <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Mask</a> to take up the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black</a> for the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a>, journeys to Europe to seek out House Cutter and their mysterious ways.\n</p><p>\nThe Eisner Award-winning team of iconic writer <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a>, legendary artist <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a>, and acclaimed colorist <a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a> close out 5 years of nightmares with this pivotal entry in the blockbuster horror saga.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG91aXNfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Louis Boucher</span> <small><i>(flashback)</i></small></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Angelique Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5nZWxpcXVlX0Nhcm5hZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Angelique Carnage</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Albie_Cutter\" title=\"Albie Cutter\">Albie Cutter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"George Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2VvcmdlX0N1dHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">George Cutter</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Saint-Georges\" title=\"Victor Saint-Georges\">Victor Saint-Georges</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1666\">1666</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"François Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRnJhbiVDMyVBN29pc19DYXJuYWdlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">François Carnage</span> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Julien Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSnVsaWVuX0Nhcm5hZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Julien Carnage</span> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Brutus Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQnJ1dHVzX0N1dHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Brutus Cutter</span> †</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Samuel_Slaughter\" title=\"Samuel Slaughter\">Samue